text:
Sa idalom sang Joint Memorandum Circular 20-04, ang mga mamumugon sa mga masunod nga sektor ang kinahanglan nga mag paidalom sa RT-PCR test;

-Tourist zones-Local manufacturing companies-Transport and logistics-Food retail-Education-Financial services-Non-food retail-Services-Public market-Construction-Water supply-Sewerage-Waste management-Public sector kag-Mass media

Ang Joint Memorandum Circular ang may yara sang koordinasyon sa Department of Trade and Industry kag epektibo na ini umpisa sang Agosto 15.

english:
Under Joint Memorandum Circular 20-04, workers in the following sectors are required to undergo RT-PCR test;

-Tourist zones-Local manufacturing companies-Transport and logistics-Food retail-Education-Financial services-Non-food retail-Services-Public market-Construction-Water supply-Sewerage-Waste management-Public sector and-Mass media

The Joint Memorandum Circular is in coordination with the Department of Trade and Industry and is effective from August 15.
